{'symbol': 'IP', 'date': '2023-01-24 16:05:00', 'title': 'INTERNATIONAL PAPER REACHES AGREEMENT TO SELL OWNERSHIP INTEREST IN ILIM JOINT VENTURE', 'text': 'MEMPHIS, TENN. , JAN. 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0INTERNATIONAL PAPER (NYSE: IP) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT\xa0HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO SELL ITS 50% INTEREST IN ILIM SA, THE HOLDING COMPANY FOR ITS ILIM JOINT VENTURE (JV), TO ITS JV PARTNERS FOR $484MM (USD) EQUITY VALUE.'}